        "description": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Description",
            "content": "<p>Familiar and delectable. Hypnotic and decadent. Vanilla Skin, unlike any other vanilla perfume, evokes an iconic creaminess wrapped in a kaleidoscope of spice and intrigue. The dual nature of pink pepper and sugar settle down through rich cashmere before nestling into a core of addictive vanilla and cozy sandalwood. Vanilla Skin is a multidimensional take on an intoxicating sensual gourmand.</p><p>Our new Vanilla Skin perfume has a higher fragrance concentration than the viral Body Mist, developed to have a longer wear time that leaves a lingering, delectable trail in your wake.</p>"
          }
        },
        "notes": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Notes",
            "content": "<p>Top: Pink Pepper, Pink Apple, Sugar Crystals<br>Heart: Lily, Jasmine Petals, Cashmere Wood<br>Base: Benzoin, Vanilla, Sandalwood, Agarwood</p>"
          }
        },
        "ingredients": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ingredients",
            "content": "<p>Please be aware that ingredient lists may change or vary from time to time. Please refer to the ingredient list on the product package you receive for the most up to date list of ingredients.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Vanilla Skin Eau de Parfum is comprised of:<br>Alcohol Denat.<br>Fragrance/Parfum*<br>Water/Eau/Aqua.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>*Fragrance Ingredients: Ethylene Brassylate, Ethyl Hydroxypyrone, Ethyl Vanillin, Vanillin, Dimethylcyclohexylethoxy Isobutylpropanoate, Ethyl Trimethylcyclopentene Butenol, Tetrahydro-Methyl-Methylpropyl)-Pyran-4-Ol, Dihydro Pentamethylindanone, Methyldihydrojasmonate, Tetramethyl Acetyloctahydronaphthalenes, Dodecahydro-Tetramethylnaphthofuran, Methyl Hydrogenated Rosinate, Oxacycloheptadec-10-En-2-One, Oxacyclohexadec-12-En-2-One, (12e), Pentadecalactone, Dipropylene Glycol, Isopropyl Myristate, Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Benzyl Benzoate, Limonene, Farnesol, Benzyl Alcohol.</p>"
          }
        },
